# music-model-artifact-watch
owner: looker · cadence: whenever Chris mentions a new music model or runner error · status: SUGGESTED
**Want a repeatable watch that scans for new MLX/quant music model builds and runner support updates as they appear?**

## Prompt
Check mlx-community and upstream model pages for new MLX/quant builds of ACE-Step 1.5, MiniMax Music 3, and Step-Audio-2-mini. Compare against wiki/comparisons/local-music-models.md. Update that page if a smaller quant or new runner-support note appears.

## Evidence
> There might be an MLX for it, or should be.
> Only 3B params active per forward pass. That means even though the model is 35B total, it should run like a 3B model — potentially 10+ tok/s. Let me get the MLX 4-bit version and test it.
